{"id":"CVE-2013-2070","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2013-07-18T01:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T15:27:39.171Z","description":"http/modules/ngx_http_proxy_module.c in nginx 1.1.4 through 1.2.8 and 1.3.0 through 1.4.0, when proxy_pass is used with untrusted HTTP servers, allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (crash) and obtain sensitive information from worker process memory via a crafted proxy response, a similar vulnerability to CVE-2013-2028.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2013/dsa-2721","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-2721"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/05/13/3","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20130513 nginx security advisory (CVE-2013-2070)"},{"url":"http://mailman.nginx.org/pipermail/nginx-announce/2013/000114.html","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[nginx-announce] 20130513 nginx security advisory (CVE-2013-2070)"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/55181","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"55181"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=962525","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2013-May/105950.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_FEDORA"],"name":"FEDORA-2013-8182"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/59824","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"59824"},{"url":"http://nginx.org/download/patch.2013.proxy.txt","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2013/q2/291","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20130507 Re: nginx security advisory (CVE-2013-2028)"},{"url":"http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201310-04.xml","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_GENTOO"],"name":"GLSA-201310-04"},{"url":"https://exchange.xforce.ibm